{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mad machinations are underfoot on the Dirt Path. Take up arms and defend the Dirt Path with divine arms.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broaden your horizons and dynamically\u00a0<strong>scale up</strong> the battle after each wave!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the the <strong>yapping wizards</strong> aiding in your Tower Defence!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the overwhelming hordes and be granted\u00a0<strong>epic</strong>\u00a0<strong>ranks</strong> from the Grand Tutorial Wizard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upend the corruption of the system and enact social change, one Gnoblin at a time... Or ruin the fields by enacting zoning for the Ballistas. Again.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Greetings!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395500/310aa666b2c1d2705ba517e1a3ec71e8a26dab88.jpg"},{"name":"Commit a War Crime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3395500/7e06e6975428eaede1be1e2c3fca2066756abebf.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395500?t=1748623895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748623895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395500/6125954ed8d32a8f5722ae2180fd89fc5782c207/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748623895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395500/6125954ed8d32a8f5722ae2180fd89fc5782c207/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748623895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mad machinations are underfoot on the Dirt Path. Take up arms and defend the Dirt Path with divine arms.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li